{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":159643,\"title\":\"Emma's Wish\",\"tagline\":\"Second chances can come in mysterious ways.\",\"overview\":\"A lonely retirement home resident obtains a magical ring on her 75th birthday which grants her wish to again be young. Awakening the next morning she finds herself to be 40 years old again. She leaves the home and takes a position as a housekeeper for her daughter, who does not recognize her.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a9JYOGwBf4HIS2UzbnobGeq3Ay4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":5,\"year\":1998,\"runtime\":106,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Mike Robe\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":82618,\"name\":\"Mike Robe\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":87038,\"name\":\"Joanna Kerns\",\"character\":\"Emma Bridges-Mame\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sylr5y79WIP6h5Q089RJARsr4kZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":56950,\"name\":\"Della Reese\",\"character\":\"Mona Washburn\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yHy7AgwkI0n5eO5LMq40J8TmDPN.jpg\"},{\"id\":27106,\"name\":\"Harley Jane Kozak\",\"character\":\"Joy Bridges-Bookman (adult)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9BMCJq4owniBRXkf8y8kEN12JTS.jpg\"},{\"id\":75331,\"name\":\"Ashley Edner\",\"character\":\"Joy Bridges-Bookman (young)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hDAeHaLcv2ctu1iiEuJlsWMdVVg.jpg\"},{\"id\":68527,\"name\":\"William R. Moses\",\"character\":\"Brian Bookman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mbGteKONCey21NqRO5sfIIKs1UF.jpg\"},{\"id\":55961,\"name\":\"Courtland Mead\",\"character\":\"Danny Bookman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/71Npi8B3YfSbOOXo5uvT5Nhn3Ah.jpg\"},{\"id\":5950,\"name\":\"Seymour Cassel\",\"character\":\"Harry Bridges (old)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3xAx3mu2VxpTIgdYe9RmSpyVwjH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1393539,\"name\":\"Jon Bruno\",\"character\":\"Harry Bookman (young)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/39UxcB2cnGqRcyWhZd9gzG0BjIL.jpg\"},{\"id\":94509,\"name\":\"Colton James\",\"character\":\"Danny Bookman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lvj7T1MKEoqITVbLkhnYswgbYoX.jpg\"},{\"id\":128012,\"name\":\"Stephanie Niznik\",\"character\":\"Kelly Horner\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nOvHotAXU5WmguTtHHj0HDyVQ8c.jpg\"},{\"id\":155825,\"name\":\"Dennis Cockrum\",\"character\":\"Det. William Steele\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A3Or26SK7GFf9nv9OVd2X5DpLuO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2798404,\"name\":\"Kristin Quick\",\"character\":\"Playing Child\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3464066,\"name\":\"Shannon Frank\",\"character\":\"Cafe Waitress\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26736,\"title\":\"Wizards of Waverly Place: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vrjLcGBLurVem5lXN8237qz4tyE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Qvc6fzE3PzodgJ9no11GlLYZJF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a family vacation, Alex, a young witch, accidentally casts a curse on her loved ones. To reverse this, she tries to find a magical stone while her brother tries to keep their parents together.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21481,\"title\":\"Twitches\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ctDK5B0uR2gre2PxQSSkJZFmh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cu00bZ1hg3Zw9lfDdtMFtvqDTzF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twins separated at birth, Camryn and Alex meet by chance for the first time on their 21st birthday and discover they're witches with the power to save their homeland of Coventry from the evil that threatens it. But when Camryn leaves Alex to face the darkness alone, will Coventry be doomed? Or will the sisters multiply their magic by standing together?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":92208,\"title\":\"Mom's Got a Date with a Vampire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2c7oXpT7y0Rtwko7vm73zWKyLUn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJe5xph6PxARGmEAYpuf06fFw45.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Hansen kids are in a jam. Adam and his best friend Duffy have gotten their hands on some tickets for the Headless Horseman concert, and his sister Chelsea has a date with her dreamy boyfriend Peter. The only problem is they're both grounded. Chelsea and Adam will do whatever it takes to get their mom Lynette out of the house, even if it includes a chance meeting with a very mysterious man. Everything seems to go according to plan until their little brother Taylor realizes that this stranger might be a vampire.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50393,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda Holiday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJv3pI8pyS13rLjy0ok7a3BiE0a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMR6Mpo8N6JVKbEuxet6N0p1NMA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Winter Feast is Po's favorite holiday. Every year he and his father hang decorations, cook together, and serve noodle soup to the villagers. But this year Shifu informs Po that as Dragon Warrior, it is his duty to host the formal Winter Feast at the Jade Palace. Po is caught between his obligations as the Dragon Warrior and his family traditions: between Shifu and Mr. Ping.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":177888,\"title\":\"Teen Beach Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sKrGe5EmDSyVaWM0uj7rJDQHRjB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uKoJTTgpyWiu04hzSgPWbyJfjYi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Life's a beach for surfers Brady and McKenzie – until a rogue wave magically transports them inside the classic '60s beach party flick, \\\"Wet Side Story,\\\" where a full-blown rivalry between bikers and surfers threatens to erupt. There, amidst a sea of surfing, singing and dancing, Brady and Mack accidentally change the storyline, and the film’s dreamy hero and heroine fall for them instead of for each other!\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":439058,\"title\":\"Hey Arnold! The Jungle Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/asBhWDiqGxelve0DtMfMFIzR0Jm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eWMHecmPAbOCqALSrq45Jqj4BhF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When their trip to San Lorenzo takes a turn for the worst, Arnold and his classmate’s only hope of getting home is retracing the dangerous path that led to Arnold's parents' disappearance.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":70338,\"title\":\"A Fairly Odd Movie: Grow Up, Timmy Turner!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h94rbv7xBNJUgweD5pMK7cpqwMO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLBMZVAV75my1nFg4JR0fKOu4ho.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The television movie is set in the city of Dimmsdale and centers on the series' main protagonist Timmy Turner with his fairy godparents Cosmo and Wanda and his fairy godbrother Poof. In the movie, Timmy is now 23 years old but is still in fifth grade with his fairy-obsessed fifth grade teacher Mr. Crocker. Despite being grown up, Timmy finds a loophole in the fairy rulebook Da Rules: if he continues to act like a kid, he will still get to keep his fairies. However, the dilemma rises when Tootie, who was once a dorky girl when she was 10 years old, returns to Dimmsdale as an attractive woman. Timmy falls in love with her, a sign that he is growing up to an adult, which means he is closer to losing his fairies. Meanwhile, an oil business tycoon named Hugh J. Magnate, Jr., who teams up with Mr. Crocker, plans to use Timmy's fairies' magic in order to promote his oil business.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":48186,\"title\":\"The Boy Who Cried Werewolf\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i7lny9FF2ylyPDwdF70ImmSbOv3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1tmcsKQo0QzAzpvm1Akmkmxstjq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Californian family inherits a castle in Romania. This is especially exciting to the son, who is obsessed with monsters. And he is not disappointed.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81393,\"title\":\"12 Dates of Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26X4Lldt6bwLnrX6kkLfUZTLojw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FwEg4xVszVPEq1Hj1GNqV208mm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In an attempt to win back her ex-boyfriend Jack on Christmas Eve, Kate ends up ruining her blind date with Miles, a handsome guy she's been set up with. In a strange twist of fate, Kate is magically given the chance to re-live Christmas Eve twelve times!\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"2V_poyNDtPw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"pvGXU6tlfj0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"34KmPcw5VgE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}